To download the authenticator configuration into a file:

<pre>
$ pki -d ~/.dogtag/pki-tomcat/ca/alias/ -c Secret.123 -n caadmin tps-authenticator-show ldap1 --output ldap1.xml
-------------------------------------------
Stored authenticator "ldap1" into ldap1.xml
-------------------------------------------
</pre>

